name wifi_to_lte_handover
describe Wi-Fi to LTE handover: 1.5 s outage, then a slower, lossier, longer path
duration 40s
at 0s  capacity=4000kbps delay=15ms jitter=5ms queue=200ms
at 15s down
at 16.5s up capacity=1200kbps delay=60ms jitter=15ms loss=1%
reverse at 0s delay=15ms
reverse at 15s down
reverse at 16.5s up delay=60ms
# Known gap: video takes ~4 s to recover from a 1.5 s outage.
expect audio.longest_interruption_ms < 2000
expect video.longest_freeze_ms < 6000
# sm_compare runs 80 seeds of both stacks here (draft #389, for #360/#365): the outcome is bimodal on both stacks, and 10 seeds can't tell libwebrtc's mode share from ours.
compare_seeds 80
